    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but i've been reading some stuff saying that highway expansion actually just creates \"induced demand\" and ends up making traffic worse in the long run anyway. if that's true, isn't it kind of a waste of money to even consider it? like, shouldn't we just focus on the more sustainable transit options?",
